VERDICT: CLEAN|FIX findings=N
| ID | sev | file:line | defect (one sentence) | fix (one sentence) |
|---|---|---|---|---|

- CLEAN requires findings=0; FIX requires one or more finding rows.
- sev: high = wrong behavior or a broken contract; med = correctness risk in a specific case; low = wording, cosmetic.
- Each defect sentence stands alone: name the mechanism and the consequence.
